      <stem>기본 주파수가 $f_{0}$인 신호 $x ( t ) = 2 \cos ( 2 \pi f_{0} t ) - 4 \sin ( 6 \pi f_{0} t )$를 복소지수함수 형식의 푸리에 급수 $x ( t ) = \sum_{n = - \infty}^{\infty} X_{n} e^{j2 \pi nf_{0} t}$로 나타낼 때, 푸리에 계수 $X_{n}$에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?</stem>
      <formulas count="9">
        <formula area="질문">f_{0}</formula>
        <formula area="질문">x ( t ) = 2 \cos ( 2 \pi f_{0} t ) - 4 \sin ( 6 \pi f_{0} t )</formula>
        <formula area="질문">x ( t ) = \sum_{n = - \infty}^{\infty} X_{n} e^{j2 \pi nf_{0} t}</formula>
        <formula area="질문">X_{n}</formula>
        <formula area="선택지①">X_{1} = 1</formula>
        <formula area="선택지②">X_{3} = 2 j</formula>
        <formula area="선택지③">\sum_{n = - \infty}^{\infty} X_{n} = 0</formula>
        <formula area="선택지④">n</formula>
        <formula area="선택지④">X_{n} + X_{- n}</formula>
      </formulas>
      <choices count="4">
        <choice no="1" is_answer="false">$X_{1} = 1$이다.</choice>
        <choice no="2" is_answer="false">$X_{3} = 2 j$이다.</choice>
        <choice no="3" is_answer="true">$\sum_{n = - \infty}^{\infty} X_{n} = 0$이다.</choice>
        <choice no="4" is_answer="false">모든 $n$에 대해 $X_{n} + X_{- n}$은 실수이다.</choice>
      </choices>
      <answer source="정답표" cross_check="">3</answer>
      <explanation_ref file="통신이론_해설.xml" question_no="12">정답 ③ · 복합 보기 검증형 (x ( t ))</explanation_ref>
    </question>
